        <div class="tabBox" id="displayTab" data-content="osaka">
          <h2>sunflower terminal (osaka) Terminal1</h2>
            <p class="l-photo"><img src="/en/route/osaka-beppu/boarding/img/img-act-osaka.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></p>
            <div class="r-block w410">
            <table class="tbl-dot">
                <tr>
                <th><strong class="txt-orange">Address</strong></th>
                <td class="exp">: ATC ITM Building 2F 2-D-6, 2-1-10 Nanko Kita, Suminoe-ku, Osaka City, Osaka<br> 559-0034 Japan</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                <th><strong class="txt-orange">Office Phone No.</strong></th>
                <td class="exp">: 06-6613-1571</td>
            </tr>
            </table>
            </div>
            
            <hr>
         <div class="gmap">
          <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d26261.274426211556!2d135.411274!3d34.638049!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6000e853289511fd%3A0xc92986b62d49bdb3!2s2-ch%C5%8Dme-1-10%20Nank%C5%8Dkita%2C%20Suminoe%20Ward%2C%20Osaka%2C%20559-0034!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjp!4v1622005736310!5m2!1sen!2sjp" width="730" height="300" frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0"></iframe>
 </div><!--/.gmap-->
          <h3>By train or bus</h3>
          <p>From either Suminoe Koen Station on the Yotsubashi Subway line or Cosmos Square Station on the Chuo Subway line, take the Newtram to &quot;Trade Center Station.&quot; The terminal is a five-minute walk away.</p>
<p><a href="/en/route/osaka-beppu/boarding/img/osaka-municipal-subway.jpg" class="arrow-o01 gallery">Osaka Municipal Subway</a></p>
            
          <h3>By car</h3>
          <p class="ttl">From Osaka City</p>
          <p>Take the "Nanko Kita" exit on the Hanshin Expressway Wangan Line. The terminal is a ten-minute drive away.</p>
          <p class="ttl">From Kansai International Airport</p>
          <p>Take the "Nanko Minami" exit on the Hanshin Expressway Wangan Line.The terminal is a 15-minute drive away.</p>
            
          <h3>From Airport</h3>
          <p class="ttl">From Kansai International Airport</p>
          <p>Take the limousine bus bound for Osaka Nanko and get off at "Hyatt Regency Osaka".<br>
          Please click <a href="https://www.kate.co.jp/en/timetable/detail/NU" target="_blank" class="window">here</a> for timetable.<br>
          From there you will arrive at the terminal in 10 minutes on foot.</p>
          <p class="ttl">From Itami Domestic Airport</p>
          <p>Go to "Namba" by limousine bus. Please click <a href="https://www.okkbus.co.jp/en/timetable/N/" target="_blank" class="window">here</a> for timetable.<br>
          Transfer to Midosuji subway line and get off at "Honmachi" station. From there transfer to Chuo subway line and take the train to "Cosmosquare" station. Transfer to Newtram line and take the newtram to "Trade Center" station.</p>


          
        </div><!--/osaka-->
        
