            <h2>Beppu Kanko-ko</h2>
            <p class="l-photo"><img src="/en/route/osaka-beppu/boarding/img/img-act-beppu-n.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></p>
            <div class="r-block w410">
            <table class="tbl-dot">
                <tr>
                <th><strong class="txt-orange">Address</strong></th>
                <td class="exp">: 944-2 Shiomi-cho, Beppu City, Oita Prefecture<br>874-0918</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                <th><strong class="txt-orange">Office Phone No.</strong></th>
                <td class="exp">: 0977-22-1311</td>
            </tr>
            </table>
            </div>
         <div class="gmap">
          <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d7910.794228369681!2d131.504098!3d33.305297!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3546a703597a1a79%3A0xd018fcd9c9ff106b!2z44GV44KT44G144KJ44KP44GC44K_44O844Of44OK44Or77yI5Yil5bqc77yJ!5e1!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1745199840770!5m2!1sja!2sjp" width="730" height="300" frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0"></iframe>
         </div><!--/.gmap-->
          <h3>By train or bus</h3>
<ul class="disc li0m">
<li>15 minutes by bus from JR Beppu Station. Three-minute walk from the &quot;Beppu kokusai kankoukou Ferry Sunflower Mae&quot; bus stop.</li>
<li>Approx. 10 minutes by taxi from JR Beppu Station.</li>
</ul>
          <h3>By car</h3>
          <p>Approx. 15 minutes from Oita Expressway Beppu IC.</p>

          <h3>From Airport</h3>
          <p class="ttl">From Oita Airport</p>
          <p>Take the express bus bound for Beppu Station (Airport Express Airliner) and get off at "Beppu Kotsu Center". <a href="https://www.oita-airport.jp/en/access/index.html" target="_blank" class="window">Route</a><br>
          Travel time is approximately 41 minutes and the cost of a ticket is JPY1400.<br>
          From there you will arrive at the terminal in 8 minutes on foot.</p>
        </div><!--/beppu-->
                
